OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells with
OL,6,Fjust isolated showers developing,
OL,7,Fperhaps heavy. Best of the sunshine
OL,8,Faround the west coast and over the
OL,9,Fislands and generally cloudier through
OL,10,Fthe Central Belt in the morning.
OL,11,FFeeling warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClouding over through the
OL,14,Fevening with some outbreaks of mostly
OL,15,Flight rain overnight, perhaps
OL,16,Foccasionally turning heavier. Mostly
OL,17,Fdry with some clearer spells for North
OL,18,FArgyll and the Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
