OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy to start with some
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain. Becoming mostly dry
OL,7,Fthrough the day with some bright
OL,8,Fspells developing but also the chance
OL,9,Fof a few showers. Breezy around coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,12,For showers at times, occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy, along with some drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,15,Flight but likely freshening on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
